# Moves the limit of IndexSummaryBuilder.java:204 to 128 MiB (case 9c): getEntrySize(DecoratedKey), whose only caller is :204,
# returns its value plus 2^31 - 1 - 128 MiB = 2013265919, so the comparison reads entries.length() + K + 8 <= 134217728.
RULE moved limit 128 MiB
CLASS org.apache.cassandra.io.sstable.indexsummary.IndexSummaryBuilder
METHOD getEntrySize(org.apache.cassandra.db.DecoratedKey)
AT EXIT
IF true
DO return $! + 2013265919
ENDRULE
